{"id":"vod_sn_38016","vodId":"38016","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"世纪末超自然学院","name_cn":"世纪末超自然学院","date":"2010-01-01","year":"2010","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/97050e24292fcac7199247a7f90b31ad.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在1999年，那个不详的世纪之末。坐落在深山之中，由于不断的发生灵异事件而被称为“超自然学院”的私立学校里，迎来了它年轻强势的新一任校长——神代玛雅（日笠阳子 配音）。绝对不相信有超自然力量存在的玛雅，此行便是为了调查父亲里奇的死因而来，这样的她，遇见了一位名叫内田文明（水岛大宙 配音）的神秘男子，刚刚登场的内田，便说出了让玛雅吃惊的话语，他居然来自未来的2012年！　　这个形迹可疑的男子的话能够相信吗？2012年的世界是怎样的景象？一连串意外让玛雅逐渐相信了内田的说辞，而内田究竟为何而回到过去，这原因也渐渐的浮出了水面。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:57:36","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/fWEvHXfkhe1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/gZhyFAaGgN1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/sJvEmr1f1e1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Ki7JGxApAH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/gh29q47XbM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/q2hjuMYUTC1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/DLHjPEJZwe1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/LnVhTzkvhC1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/rQxhJSAZFR1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/RLhhdfZPfH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/nYkGHXvxda1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/U1JpWN3Lxj1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/j5xifR55jP1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:03.771Z"}